msgstr "Project-Id-Version: Orbit 1.0\nReport-Msgid-Bugs-To: \nPOT-Creation-Date: 2026-10-29 15:37+0800\nPO-Revision-Date: 2026-10-29 20:00+0800\nLast-Translator: junjunlab\nLanguage: zh_CN\nLanguage-Team: zh_CN <LL@li.org>\nPlural-Forms: nplurals=1; plural=0;\nMIME-Version: 1.0\nContent-Type: text/plain; charset=utf-8\nContent-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit\nGenerated-By: Babel 2.18.0\n"

msgid "Installation"
msgstr "安装"

msgid "Pick the package for your platform from the `Releases page <https://github.com/junjunlab/Orbit/releases>`_."
msgstr "在 `发布页面 <https://github.com/junjunlab/Orbit/releases>`_ 中选择适合你平台的安装包。"

msgid "Platform"
msgstr "平台"

msgid "File"
msgstr "文件"

msgid "Size"
msgstr "大小"

msgid "Windows 10/11 x64"
msgstr "Windows 10/11 x64"

msgid "``Orbit-1.0.2-Windows-x64-Setup.exe``"
msgstr "``Orbit-1.0.2-Windows-x64-Setup.exe``"

msgid "~150 MB"
msgstr "约 150 MB"

msgid "macOS, Apple Silicon"
msgstr "macOS，Apple Silicon"

msgid "``Orbit-1.0.2-macOS-arm64.dmg``"
msgstr "``Orbit-1.0.2-macOS-arm64.dmg``"

msgid "~244 MB"
msgstr "约 244 MB"

msgid "macOS, Intel"
msgstr "macOS，Intel"

msgid "``Orbit-1.0.2-macOS-x86_64.dmg``"
msgstr "``Orbit-1.0.2-macOS-x86_64.dmg``"

msgid "~253 MB"
msgstr "约 253 MB"

msgid "Windows"
msgstr "Windows"

msgid "Run the installer. It is a **per-user** installation: no administrator rights are required and nothing is written outside your profile."
msgstr "运行安装程序。这是**按用户**安装：不需要管理员权限，也不会向用户目录之外写入任何内容。"

msgid "Program files: ``%LOCALAPPDATA%\\Programs\\Orbit``"
msgstr "程序文件：``%LOCALAPPDATA%\\Programs\\Orbit``"

msgid "Settings and logs: ``%LOCALAPPDATA%\\Orbit``"
msgstr "设置与日志：``%LOCALAPPDATA%\\Orbit``"

msgid "The installer offers a desktop shortcut (off by default) and can launch Orbit when it finishes."
msgstr "安装程序可选择创建桌面快捷方式（默认关闭），并在结束时可直接启动 Orbit。"

msgid "The executable is not code-signed, so Windows SmartScreen may show *\"Windows protected your PC\"*. Choose **More info → Run anyway**."
msgstr "可执行文件未做代码签名，Windows SmartScreen 可能弹出 *\"Windows 已保护你的电脑\"*。请选择 **更多信息 → 仍要运行**。"

msgid "macOS"
msgstr "macOS"

msgid "Open the ``.dmg`` and drag **Orbit** into *Applications*."
msgstr "打开 ``.dmg``，把 **Orbit** 拖入 *应用程序*。"

msgid "The build is ad-hoc signed but **not notarized**, so the first launch is blocked by Gatekeeper. Either:"
msgstr "该构建只做了临时签名（ad-hoc），**未经过公证**，因此首次启动会被 Gatekeeper 拦截。可以任选一种方式："

msgid "right-click (or Control-click) the app and choose **Open**, then confirm, or"
msgstr "右键（或按住 Control 点击）应用图标，选择 **打开**，然后确认；或者"

msgid "run once in Terminal::"
msgstr "在终端中执行一次::"

msgid "If macOS reports the app is *damaged and can't be opened*, the quarantine attribute is the cause — the ``xattr`` command above fixes it."
msgstr "如果 macOS 提示应用 *已损坏，无法打开*，那是隔离属性（quarantine）导致的 — 上面那条 ``xattr`` 命令即可解决。"

msgid "Command line"
msgstr "命令行"

msgid "The frozen build accepts the same options as the Python module, which is handy for scripts and for running several instances side by side."
msgstr "打包后的程序接受与 Python 模块相同的选项，便于写脚本，也便于同时运行多个实例。"

msgid "Option"
msgstr "选项"

msgid "Meaning"
msgstr "含义"

msgid "``--data PATH``"
msgstr "``--data PATH``"

msgid "Use another data directory instead of the bundled one"
msgstr "改用其他数据目录，而不是随包附带的那一份"

msgid "``--port N``"
msgstr "``--port N``"

msgid "Listen on a different port (default ``8765``)"
msgstr "监听其他端口（默认 ``8765``）"

msgid "``--host HOST``"
msgstr "``--host HOST``"

msgid "Bind address (default ``127.0.0.1``)"
msgstr "绑定地址（默认 ``127.0.0.1``）"

msgid "``--browser``"
msgstr "``--browser``"

msgid "Open the system browser instead of the native window"
msgstr "改用系统浏览器打开，而不是原生窗口"

msgid "``--no-browser``"
msgstr "``--no-browser``"

msgid "Headless: serve the API only"
msgstr "无界面模式：只提供 API 服务"

msgid "``--debug``"
msgstr "``--debug``"

msgid "Verbose logging, plus JavaScript console output from the window"
msgstr "输出详细日志，并把窗口中的 JavaScript 控制台信息一并打印"

msgid "For a second instance, use a different port. To isolate imported data too, prepare a separate compatible data folder and pass it with ``--data``::"
msgstr "第二个实例应使用不同端口。如需同时隔离导入数据，请准备独立且结构兼容的数据目录，并通过 ``--data`` 指定："

msgid "Changing the port alone does not isolate data. Do not rely on an unsupported ``ORBIT_HOME`` setting to separate research files."
msgstr "只更换端口不会隔离数据。不要依赖未支持的 ``ORBIT_HOME`` 设置来隔离科研文件。"

msgid "Where things are stored"
msgstr "文件存放位置"

msgid "What"
msgstr "内容"

msgid "Location"
msgstr "位置"

msgid "Preferences, session, Qt cache"
msgstr "偏好设置、会话、Qt 缓存"

msgid "``%LOCALAPPDATA%\\Orbit`` (Windows), ``~/Library/Application Support/Orbit`` (macOS)"
msgstr "``%LOCALAPPDATA%\\Orbit`` (Windows)、``~/Library/Application Support/Orbit`` (macOS)"

msgid "Application log"
msgstr "应用日志"

msgid "``orbit.log`` in the directory above"
msgstr "位于上述目录中的 ``orbit.log``"

msgid "Annotation and assemblies"
msgstr "注释与装配"

msgid "``data/`` next to the executable"
msgstr "可执行文件旁边的 ``data/``"

msgid "Uninstalling"
msgstr "卸载"

msgid "Use *Add or remove programs* on Windows, or move the app to the Bin on macOS. User data may remain in ``%LOCALAPPDATA%/Orbit`` or the application data folder. Back up imported research files before uninstalling. Do not delete an entire user-data folder merely to reset colours or another display preference."
msgstr "Windows 可通过“添加或删除程序”卸载，macOS 可将应用移到废纸篓。用户数据可能仍保存在 ``%LOCALAPPDATA%/Orbit`` 或应用数据目录中。卸载前请备份导入的科研文件，不要仅为了重置颜色等显示偏好而删除整个用户数据目录。"
